course: dictionary
lesson: 5710
title: One word, many meanings: long
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word long can mean different things. Read the words around it to find out which meaning fits. «The hyacinth macaw is about a metre long from beak to tail.» Here long measures length, from one end to the other.
explain: Long can also measure time. «Time feels shorter when you are playing and longer when you are waiting.» Here long means lasting a big amount of time. Ask yourself: is this word about how far, or how long a time?
explain: Long can be a verb too. «I long for the summer holidays» means I want them very much. Long for something is a strong feeling of wanting it.
explain: In chatty talk, long has special phrases. «Long story short, we missed the bus» means I will skip the details. Always swap in a meaning and check that the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Long can measure length: «a metre long» means one metre from end to end.
fact: Long can measure time: «a long time» means a big amount of time.
fact: «Long ago» means a long time in the past.
fact: To long for something means to want it very much.
fact: «Long story short» is casual talk and means I will skip the details.
exercise: «The hyacinth macaw is about a metre long from beak to tail.» What does long tell us here? | *How much length it has from end to end | How many birds live together | How old the bird is | How loud the bird sings
exercise: «Its nose was damaged long before Napoleon's soldiers came.» What does long mean here? | *A big amount of time before | Just after | Very close to | Very loudly
exercise: Mia says, «Long story short, we missed the bus.» What does long story short mean? | We need a longer bus | We are going on a long trip | *I will skip the details and get to the point | The story is very long and I will tell every detail
test: «Ben longs for a puppy of his own.» What does longs for mean? | *Wants very much | Runs very fast | Forgets completely | Gets very tired
test: «The Great Sphinx was carved from rock long ago.» Which words show long is about time? | long carved | long Sphinx | long rock | *long ago
exam: In an exam text, «the duration of the journey» means: | How far the journey goes | The name of the driver | The kind of vehicle used | *How long the journey lasts
